      "type": "RECORDED_STEP",
      "transition": "letterbox",
      "background": "zoneB",
      "narration": "Apple's page says it in its own words: the A20 Pro with the dual sixteen core Neural Engine, purpose built for intensive AI workloads. Same chip as the Pro, different body around it, and that matters more than it sounds. A first generation product usually ships with last year's silicon, and you feel that every day for two years. This one gets the fastest chip Apple makes on the day it goes on sale.",
